  "description": "Fairclinic Patient Balances: dental patient and guarantor balances aged, with the next step for each account: credits for a person to check, missed payment-plan payments, money over 90 days for collections review, no recent statement, waiting on insurance, small balances; and a plain balance reminder for one named person to send. Names and account numbers are masked before results reach the model.",
